by 4:30 in the morning

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:32.220
and then I walk to
school every single day.

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:34.173
You can put a 10 for this clip.

00:10:34.173 --> 00:10:35.280
It's the real deal.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.110
It's like that's how life is.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:38.940
- Ah Jesus Christ,

