color they want to wrestle in.

00:11:08.070 --> 00:11:08.903
This is called "sagari."

00:11:08.903 --> 00:11:13.200
If you go to the Shinto, you
go to any temple or any shrines

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:14.430
